      "SectionIndex2": 9
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 16,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "که محنت کدام است و راحت کدام",
      "CoupletIndex": 7,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 9
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 17,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "بهائی، دل از آرزوها بشو",
      "CoupletIndex": 8,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 10
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 18,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "که من طالعت می‌شناسم، مگو",
      "CoupletIndex": 8,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 10
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 19,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "اگر باده گردد حلالت دمی",
